1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,830
Gus: So my clay needed to be flat and wide?

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:08,860
Gran Mari: Well now, what do you think happens next?

3
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,860
Ollie: If we flatten the clay, it will float!

4
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:32,880
Gran Mari: Too much on one side, and it tips. Not a mistake, just something to learn. So we try again.

5
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:50,060
Ollie: Try it at home! Fill a sink with water. Squeeze one piece of foil into a ball. Fold another into a wide boat.
